      "summaries": {
        "en": "Odoo is an open-source ERP and business application suite that helps companies manage sales, inventory, accounting, HR, and more from a single platform. Its modular architecture lets you start with one app and add others as needed, avoiding the bloat of traditional ERP systems. You can deploy it on-premise or in the cloud, customize modules via Python, and integrate with third-party tools through its API. Ideal for SMEs seeking an affordable, scalable business management solution.",
        "zh": "Odoo是一套开源ERP与商业应用套件，通过单一平台统一管理销售、库存、财务、人力资源等核心业务流程。其模块化架构允许用户仅安装所需应用（如CRM、电商、会计），按需扩展，避免系统臃肿。技术层面，Odoo采用Python开发，支持前后端高度定制，内置强大工作流引擎和报表工具。部署方式灵活，可本地运行或使用云服务。对中小企业而言，Odoo提供低成本、渐进式实施的数字化管理方案，是替代昂贵商业ERP的理想选择。",
        "es": "Odoo is an open-source ERP and business application suite that helps companies manage sales, inventory, accounting, HR, and more from a single platform. Its modular architecture lets you start with one app and add others as needed, avoiding the bloat of traditional ERP systems. You can deploy it on-premise or in the cloud, customize modules via Python, and integrate with third-party tools through its API. Ideal for SMEs seeking an affordable, scalable business management solution.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "odoo stands out for apps, business, and erp in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Odoo is an open-source ERP and business application suite that helps companies manage sales, inventory, accounting, HR, and more from a single platform. Its modular architecture lets you start with one app and add others as needed, avoiding the bloat of traditional ERP systems. You can deploy it on-premise or in the cloud, customize modules via Python, and integrate with third-party tools through its API. Ideal for SMEs seeking an affordable, scalable business management solution.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/odoo/odoo for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
