      "summaries": {
        "en": "cfnew is a lightweight framework for building and deploying custom AI models with minimal code. It leverages a modular architecture that separates model definition, training, and inference, enabling rapid prototyping. The key insight is its use of configuration files to define model architectures, reducing boilerplate. You can use it to quickly experiment with different neural network designs or deploy models to production with a single command.",
        "zh": "cfnew是一个轻量级框架，旨在用最少的代码构建和部署自定义AI模型。它采用模块化架构，将模型定义、训练和推理分离，支持快速原型开发。核心设计理念是通过配置文件定义模型结构，大幅减少样板代码。你可以用它快速尝试不同的神经网络设计，或通过单条命令将模型部署到生产环境。适合需要快速迭代实验的AI开发者，尤其适合从研究到落地的过渡阶段。",
        "es": "cfnew is a lightweight framework for building and deploying custom AI models with minimal code. It leverages a modular architecture that separates model definition, training, and inference, enabling rapid prototyping. The key insight is its use of configuration files to define model architectures, reducing boilerplate. You can use it to quickly experiment with different neural network designs or deploy models to production with a single command.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "cfnew gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "cfnew is a lightweight framework for building and deploying custom AI models with minimal code. It leverages a modular architecture that separates model definition, training, and inference, enabling rapid prototyping. The key insight is its use of configuration files to define model architectures, reducing boilerplate. You can use it to quickly experiment with different neural network designs or deploy models to production with a single command.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/byJoey/cfnew for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
