      "summaries": {
        "en": "ELECTRA-Small-Discriminator is a compact pretrained language model that learns to detect replaced tokens in text, making training more sample-efficient than masked language modeling. Its key innovation is a generator-discriminator setup where the discriminator identifies tokens replaced by a small generator, enabling strong performance with fewer parameters. Use it for downstream tasks like text classification or sequence labeling by fine-tuning with Hugging Face Transformers, or as a lightweight feature extractor for resource-constrained applications.",
        "zh": "ELECTRA-Small-Discriminator 是一种轻量级预训练语言模型，通过检测文本中被替换的标记来学习，相比掩码语言建模，训练效率更高。其核心技术是生成器-判别器架构：小型生成器替换部分标记，判别器则判断每个标记是否被替换，从而在参数量较少的情况下获得强大性能。你可以使用 Hugging Face Transformers 对其进行微调，应用于文本分类、序列标注等下游任务，或作为资源受限场景下的轻量特征提取器。该模型特别适合需要快速部署且计算资源有限的实际应用。",
        "es": "ELECTRA-Small-Discriminator is a compact pretrained language model that learns to detect replaced tokens in text, making training more sample-efficient than masked language modeling. Its key innovation is a generator-discriminator setup where the discriminator identifies tokens replaced by a small generator, enabling strong performance with fewer parameters. Use it for downstream tasks like text classification or sequence labeling by fine-tuning with Hugging Face Transformers, or as a lightweight feature extractor for resource-constrained applications.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "electra-small-discriminator stands out for transformers, pytorch, and tf in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "ELECTRA-Small-Discriminator is a compact pretrained language model that learns to detect replaced tokens in text, making training more sample-efficient than masked language modeling. Its key innovation is a generator-discriminator setup where the discriminator identifies tokens replaced by a small generator, enabling strong performance with fewer parameters. Use it for downstream tasks like text classification or sequence labeling by fine-tuning with Hugging Face Transformers, or as a lightweight feature extractor for resource-constrained applications.",
          "how": "Review https://huggingface.co/google/electra-small-discriminator for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
